***{{item link|Dvergr Spiral Staircase Right}}
***{{item link|Dvergr Wall Lantern}}
**[[Ashlands]]
***{{item link|Shield Generator}}
}}

== Notes ==
* Like other metals, Copper cannot be teleported, without a [[Portal stone]] (As of the [[Ashlands]] update).

